{"route": "cv_question", "lang": "en", "answer": "AgentBrain is a private project of Christopher's, running since 10/2026. It is a multi-agent system built on Claude Code. An Obsidian vault holds the notes, and a manager agent hands tasks to ten specialist agents, for example for video, development, research, career and design. The system has shared memory, skills and MCP servers.

It also has a local vault search that runs in one call and combines keywords, vectors and a link graph. In his own test with 187 questions, this search was 49 % cheaper than his previous search at the same answer quality. The agents use cloud models, and only the search runs locally.

Claude Code is a private tool that Christopher uses daily for this project. It is not part of his work at DATEV.", "tool_calls": [], "show_form": false}
